/P 261 0 R
/E (If you do not have an installment loan reported on your credit reports, consider whether it makes sense to get one. If you are going to borrow anyway or want to consolidate higher-rate credit card debt, a personal installment loan may be helpful. Another strategy is to get a low-rate car loan and then pay it off as quickly as possible. It will still count even if you pay it off a few months after you get it.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
