/Title (Inquiries may or may not affect your FICO score. A FICO score takes into account only voluntary inquiries that result from your application for credit. The information about inquiries that can be factored into your FICO score includes the number of recently opened accounts and the proportion of accounts that are recently opened, by type of account.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
